#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:5 1f1fbe3626944a74b5d8f9ea8aebda05
msgid "Nooploop for Non-GPS Navigation"
msgstr "Nooploop 用于非 GPS 导航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:9 a872704409a1490abc34e74395f90d96
msgid ""
"This article explains how a `Nooploop <https://www.nooploop.com/en/>`__ "
"system based on UWB(Ultra Wide Band) technology can be used as a short-range"
" substitute for a GPS allowing position control modes like Loiter, PosHold, "
"RTL, Auto indoors."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用基于 UWB（超宽带）技术的 `Nooploop <https://www.nooploop.com/en/>`__ 系统作为 GPS "
"的短距离替代方案，在室内实现 Loiter、PosHold、RTL、Auto 等位置控制飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:12 199c11c607674986af257f85740e588c
msgid "Required Hardware"
msgstr "所需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:14 bf17d28e79f44960a96a8e7cfaf2a77c
msgid "5 Nooploop LinkTrack nodes."
msgstr "5 个 Nooploop LinkTrack 节点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:15 df0f9ca775484ff9a5ba522417d4ee80
msgid ""
"one `Arduino Nano Every <https://store.arduino.cc/usa/nano-every>`__ "
"(optional)"
msgstr ""
"一块 `Arduino Nano Every <https://store.arduino.cc/usa/nano-every>`__（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:16 febc7494c477485093d0427c793f9e14
msgid ""
"4 `portable chargers <https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss_2?url=search-"
"alias%3Daps&field-"
"keywords=portable+charger&rh=i%3Aaps%2Ck%3Aportable+charger>`__ with type A "
"USB ports to power the anchors (optional)"
msgstr ""
"4 个带 A 型 USB 接口的 `移动电源 "
"<https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss_2?url=search-alias%3Daps&field-"
"keywords=portable+charger&rh=i%3Aaps%2Ck%3Aportable+charger>`__ 用于为锚点供电（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:17 f69a73e895e94befbbb4cf345aba7c57
msgid ""
"4 `tripods <https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss_1?url=search-"
"alias%3Daps&field-keywords=tripod&rh=i%3Aaps%2Ck%3Atripod>`__ to mount the "
"anchors (optional)"
msgstr ""
"4 个 `三脚架 <https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss_1?url=search-"
"alias%3Daps&field-keywords=tripod&rh=i%3Aaps%2Ck%3Atripod>`__ 用于固定锚点（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:20 cad5fce245b24e86a95c69dc29d8a348
msgid "Preparing the anchors"
msgstr "准备锚点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:22 c86c0362fe1341d59d4ab34c3b77d045
msgid ""
"4 Nooploop nodes need to be configured to act as anchors. Follow Nooploop "
"`LinkTrack user manual <https://www.nooploop.com/en/download/>`__ to setup "
"and calibrate them."
msgstr ""
"需要将 4 个 Nooploop 节点配置为锚点。请参考 Nooploop `LinkTrack 用户手册 "
"<https://www.nooploop.com/en/download/>`__ 进行设置和校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:25 26f25e1e284d4c85888319303d5d7259
msgid "Placing the anchors"
msgstr "放置锚点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:27 47048235ece4498d952b2419e40996b1
msgid ""
"The anchors should be placed in a rectangular shape. Anchor 0 will act as "
"\"origin\" and Y axis of Nooploop system will act as \"North\". The "
"configuration is slightly simpler if the line from anchor 0 to anchor 1 is "
"due North but it is not required as the :ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW "
"<BCN_ORIENT_YAW>` parameter can be used to account this difference."
msgstr ""
"锚点应呈矩形摆放。锚点 0 作为「原点」，Nooploop 系统的 Y 轴作为「北」方向。若锚点 0 到锚点 1 "
"的连线正好指向正北则配置最为简便，但这并非必须，可通过 :ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>` 参数补偿偏差。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:33 c214d14746514435a45b99c16d5e435f
msgid "Preparing the tag"
msgstr "准备标签"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:35 0306798b119742af9be8f797896340f6
msgid "Use Nooploop NAssistant tool to configure one node to act as a tag."
msgstr "使用 Nooploop NAssistant 工具将一个节点配置为标签。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:37 0a11bca9acad4252b43b7a3c68fce928
msgid "set Protocol to Node_Frame2"
msgstr "将协议设置为 Node_Frame2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:38 30104d6a1636453392aae012934e3bbb
msgid "set Baudrate to 921600"
msgstr "将波特率设置为 921600"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:39 63a9204bee1143c3b2de8098cd2b48ff
msgid "set Update Rate to 25"
msgstr "将更新频率设置为 25"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:40 b212d668b9bf423abdbddade6d7d4d5f
msgid "set Filter Factor to 0"
msgstr "将滤波系数设置为 0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:46 25383c9594f54b34910af09aae337712
msgid "Connecting the tag to the Flight Controller"
msgstr "将标签连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:48 0b573bf0e6384c2fa20302f51626f1f1
msgid ""
"It is possible to directly connect UART port of the tag to the FC. However, "
"UART Tx of certain FCs is not compatible with Nooploop UART Rx (According to"
" developers at Nooploop, it seems to be caused by a CP2012 inside Nooploop "
"nodes. It is possible that this problem can be solved by removing this "
"CP2012). It causes the FC to be unable to communicate with the tag. Pixhawk "
"4 mini and Kakute F7 are confirmed to have this issue. In this case, an "
"Arduino Nano Every can be used as a work-around. Use Ardnio IDE to upload "
"`Nooploop work-around sketch "
"<https://github.com/chobitsfan/nooploop_workaround.git>`__ to a Arduino Nano"
" Every and connect its UART Tx to UART Rx of the tag. For the following we "
"assume that the tag is connected to the FC's UART port corresponding to "
"SERIAL1."
msgstr ""
"可以将标签的 UART 端口直接连接到飞控。但是，某些飞控的 UART Tx 与 Nooploop UART Rx 不兼容（据 Nooploop "
"开发人员称，这似乎是由 Nooploop 节点内部的 CP2012 引起的。移除该 CP2012 "
"后此问题可能可以解决）。这会导致飞控无法与标签通信。已确认 Pixhawk 4 mini 和 Kakute F7 存在此问题。在这种情况下，可以使用 "
"Arduino Nano Every 作为变通方案。使用 Arduino IDE 将 `Nooploop 变通方案草图 "
"<https://github.com/chobitsfan/nooploop_workaround.git>`__ 上传到 Arduino Nano "
"Every，并将其 UART Tx 连接到标签的 UART Rx。以下假设标签已连接到飞控对应 SERIAL1 的 UART 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:54 f67be82ed282476293b2978bf713f52e
msgid "Configuration through the Ground Station"
msgstr "通过地面站进行配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:56 2dd4331af6f44b7a98236b4771bd8998
msgid ""
"Ensure that Copter is loaded onto the autopilot and connect with a Ground "
"Station (i.e. Mission Planner)."
msgstr "确保飞控已加载 Copter 固件，并通过地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:58 1377d8a6e09e4013953eff6cd683e4f2
msgid "set :ref:`BCN_TYPE <BCN_TYPE>` to 3 (means using Nooploop system)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`BCN_TYPE <BCN_TYPE>` 设置为 3（表示使用 Nooploop 系统）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:59 a9771b3f70a7453298eadf3d0a8efc33
msgid ""
"set :ref:`BCN_LATITUDE <BCN_LATITUDE>`, :ref:`BCN_LONGITUDE <BCN_LONGITUDE>`"
" and :ref:`BCN_ALT <BCN_ALT>` to match your actual location.  Getting these "
"values exactly correct is not particularly important although getting them "
"close is required in order for the compass's declination to be correctly "
"looked up from the database held within ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BCN_LATITUDE <BCN_LATITUDE>`、:ref:`BCN_LONGITUDE <BCN_LONGITUDE>` 和 "
":ref:`BCN_ALT <BCN_ALT>` 设置为与您的实际位置匹配。精确匹配这些值并非特别重要，但需要足够接近，以便从 ArduPilot "
"内置数据库中正确查找罗盘磁偏角。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:60 edf4b25a7f9d4a35984f6fa1b84b2ce4
msgid ""
"set :ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>` to the heading from the origin "
"anchor to the 2nd anchor.  One way to capture this value is to stand at the "
"origin holding the vehicle so that its nose points towards the second "
"beacon.  Read the vehicle's heading from the HUD and enter this value into "
":ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>`"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>` "
"设置为从原点锚到第二个锚的航向。获取此值的一种方法是站在原点，手持飞行器使其机头指向第二个信标。从 HUD 读取飞行器航向，并将该值输入 "
":ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:61 1f0c9adc77154603a77489811c7c3b7f
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_BCN_DELAY <EK3_BCN_DELAY>` to 20"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_BCN_DELAY <EK3_BCN_DELAY>` 设置为 20"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:62 d2e7e9b5ebda490fb32670c8991cb61d
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` to 4 (\"Beacon\")"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` 设置为 4（「Beacon」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:63 26e8d3d03c444b42abd7fc43dc785307
msgid ""
"set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` to 4 (\"Beacon\") to use NoopLoop "
"for altitude or leave at \"1\" to use the barometer"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` 设置为 4（「Beacon」）以使用 Nooploop "
"作为高度来源，或保留为「1」以使用气压计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:64 bf969fe7768a4034b7ef1e72f7abdd38
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` to 0 (\"None\")"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` 设置为 0（「None」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:65 0ed0f7054d0d422f9308b9675db21beb
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` to 0 (\"None\")"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` 设置为 0（「None」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:66 419998dfd6a04c35bc1e4c9af48a43e6
msgid ""
"set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW<EK3_SRC1_YAW>` to 1 (\"Compass\") since a compass "
"must be used in conjunction with this device."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW<EK3_SRC1_YAW>` 设置为 1（「Compass」），因为使用此设备时必须同时使用罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:67 bb536655296642238969e277427705b2
msgid "set :ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` to 0 to disable the GPS"
msgstr "将 :ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` 设置为 0 以禁用 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:68 33065bc7adfb43a09b05cd77e0a1d4f5
msgid ""
"set :ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` to -9 to disable the GPS arming check"
msgstr "将 :ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` 设置为 -9 以禁用 GPS 解锁检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:69 1a073f467ed949baa70f4745d75c324c
msgid ""
"set :ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` to 921 to set SERIAL1's baud rate to "
"921600"
msgstr "将 :ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` 设置为 921，将 SERIAL1 的波特率设置为 921600"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:70 449c497b6196476f9dc2fee444d175ff
msgid ""
"set :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` to 13 to enable reading the "
"IndoorLoiter2 protocol"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 13 以启用读取 IndoorLoiter2 协议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:71 cc3de3b8d100455eb7c8de58170d93f3
msgid ""
"set :ref:`BRD_SER1_RTSCTS <BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` to 0 to ensure SERIAL1 does not"
" use flow control, assuming it has this capability."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BRD_SER1_RTSCTS <BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` 设置为 0 以确保 SERIAL1 "
"不使用流控制（假设具有该功能）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:74 4ceb026c18984c19a7d0023fcad724d4
msgid "Ground Testing"
msgstr "地面测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:76 2aac5d9e4a7b4c1eab4bdf6e25ba320f
msgid "Connect the Autopilot to a ground station."
msgstr "将飞控连接到地面站。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:77 b64805773d8a446db57e282885b4ee35
msgid ""
"After about 1 minute the vehicle's position should jump to the latitude, "
"longitude you input during the configuration step (above)."
msgstr "约 1 分钟后，飞行器位置应跳转到配置步骤中输入的经纬度位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:78 7bcdfe34f3054d8d94ff68b4c69c1e83
msgid ""
"Check that the vehicle's position is relatively stable (i.e. moving around "
"less than one meter)"
msgstr "检查飞行器位置是否相对稳定（即移动范围小于 1 米）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:79 54229416661045c4acf2cbd9649efe74
msgid ""
"Walk the vehicle around between the anchors and ensure that its position on "
"the map updates correctly"
msgstr "在锚点之间移动飞行器，确认地图上的位置更新正确"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:82 90934880c9d240339ecdb0a915e0c668
msgid "Flight testing"
msgstr "飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:84 4f7e797227444c43a24cd3981ea29a91
msgid ""
"Setup the transmitter with Stabilize, AltHold and Loiter flight modes. Take "
"off in AltHold mode and maintain a stable hover. Switch to Loiter but be "
"ready to switch back to AltHold or Stabilize if the vehicle's position or "
"altitude becomes unstable."
msgstr ""
"在遥控器上设置 Stabilize、AltHold 和 Loiter 飞行模式。在 AltHold 模式下起飞，保持稳定悬停。切换到 "
"Loiter，但如果飞行器位置或高度变得不稳定，请随时切换回 AltHold 或 Stabilize。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:89 3c47e12cde8b4698acfa4d9eddcae535
msgid "DataFlash logging"
msgstr "DataFlash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-nooploop.rst:91 c8dfc91335ab4a46b1f01f1662185d9c
msgid ""
"The distance to the beacons can be found in the dataflash log's BCN "
"message's D0, D1, D2, D3 fields."
msgstr "到信标的距离可以在 DataFlash 日志的 BCN 消息的 D0、D1、D2、D3 字段中找到。"
